WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:06.629
Hello, my name is Josie and I've been
renting the Eight Sleep mattress from

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:09.139
Whim for

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:15.819
five months now. Um, I did it because
my credit card was running on promo and

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:20.099
for one month, and I ended up keeping
it because I absolutely love it.

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:23.040
And especially living
in Southern California,

00:00:23.439 --> 00:00:28.599
there's not a lot of air condition, and
it has really saved me all summer in

00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:30.960
this heat. Um, and I've

00:00:31.559 --> 00:00:33.559
honestly been getting the
best sleep of my life.

00:00:34.039 --> 00:00:37.579
So if you are not sure about
it or you wanna try it out,

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:40.739
definitely use Whim and see for yourself.
